From 30b9ac55a15ee6acadcc3db0a5d1b2670639ddb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: farrizdesignpro1339 <229765408+farrizdesignpro1339@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:50:55 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] redmi_a5: ZRAM einschalten

- CONFIG_ZRAM=y (eingebaut) mit ZSMALLOC-Backend
- Kompressor ZSTD vorkonfiguriert (CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_ZSTD,
  CONFIG_ZRAM_DEF_COMP_ZSTD) - beste Kompression bei geringem CPU-Kosten
- Aktivierung ueber systemd zram-generator: /etc/systemd/zram-generator.conf
  mit zram-size=4096; /dev/zram0 erscheint dann beim naechsten Start
- Test hinterher auf dem Handy: ls /dev/zram0, swapon --show, free -m

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig
index ab7a06f..a904427 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig
@@ -1052,3 +1052,7 @@ CONFIG_SND_SOC_UMS9230_DIGITAL=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_AW8738=m
 CONFIG_TYPEC_SC27XX_PD=m
 CONFIG_SECURITY_LANDLOCK=y
+CONFIG_ZSMALLOC=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_ZSTD=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM_DEF_COMP_ZSTD=y
-- 
2.56.0
